{
  "title": "Public Servers",
  "description": "Public REST servers other people run, each as `spell place ingest` wrote it, untouched, and each a page of its own.  GitHub:  a key named, never written, taken from the environment when it's set and gone without when it isn't;  lists that page by their Link header;  a rate limit read politely",
